DESCRIPTION:100% Badgers 2: Badgers vs hedgehogs is a stand-up comedy show 
 about the worlds of badgers\, hedgehogs\, and being one of the country's pr
 emier badger comedians. Following his critically acclaimed and sold out 202
 5 Edinburgh Fringe show 100% Badgers ('hilarious and heartfelt' ****½\, Ed
 inburgh-Reviews.co.uk)\, Matt has trained to be a badger rescuer\, been ask
 ed to help in the fight for badger rights\, and has had a badger move in to
  his garden. Matt will also address the eternal question: What are better\,
  badgers or hedgehogs?\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
 nt/100-badgers-2-badgers-vs-hedgehogs-with-matt-hobs-26069/
